      },
      {
        "id": "w15",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20180718014601/http://corporate.exxonmobil.com/en/company/about-us/management/darren-w-woods",
        "title": "Darren W. Woods | ExxonMobil (official management biography, archived copy of 2018-07-18)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Woods joined Exxon Company International in 1992 as a planning analyst in Florham Park, New Jersey. He progressed through a number of domestic and international assignments for Exxon Company International, ExxonMobil Chemical Company and ExxonMobil Refining and Supply Company.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "w16",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20180718014601/http://corporate.exxonmobil.com/en/company/about-us/management/darren-w-woods",
        "title": "Darren W. Woods | ExxonMobil (official management biography, archived copy of 2018-07-18)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "In 2005, Mr. Woods was appointed vice president of ExxonMobil Chemical Company in Houston, Texas, where he managed global specialty-chemical businesses.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "w17",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20180718014601/http://corporate.exxonmobil.com/en/company/about-us/management/darren-w-woods",
        "title": "Darren W. Woods | ExxonMobil (official management biography, archived copy of 2018-07-18)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "In 2008, he was named ExxonMobil Refining and Supply Company’s director of refining for Europe, Africa and the Middle East, and was based in Brussels.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "w18",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20180718014601/http://corporate.exxonmobil.com/en/company/about-us/management/darren-w-woods",
